          %title
          %h3#TopologicalQuantumComputationWithAnyons Topological quantum computation with anyons
          %p
            The idea of
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/topological+quantum+computation"} topological quantum computation
            via a
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Chern-Simons+theory"} Chern-Simons theory
            with
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/anyon"} anyon
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/braiding"} braiding
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/defects"} defects
            is due to:
          %ul
            %li#Kitaev03
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Alexei+Kitaev"}> Alexei Kitaev
                ,
                = succeed "," do
                  %em Fault-tolerant quantum computation by anyons
                = succeed "," do
                  %a{:href => "https://doi.org/10.1016/S0003-4916(02)00018-0"} doi:10.1016/S0003-4916(02)00018-0
                = succeed "]" do
                  %a{:href => "https://arxiv.org/abs/quant-ph/9707021"} arXiv:quant-ph/9707021
            %li#Freedman98
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Michael+Freedman"}> Michael Freedman
                ,
                = succeed "," do
                  %em P/NP, and the quantum field computer
                %strong 95
                1 (1998) 98-101 [
                %a{:href => "https://doi.org/10.1073/pnas.95.1.9"}> doi:10.1073/pnas.95.1.9
                ]
            %li#FreedmanKitaevLarsenWang03
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Michael+Freedman"}> Michael Freedman
                ,
                = succeed "," do
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Alexei+Kitaev"} Alexei Kitaev
                = succeed "," do
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Michael+Larsen"} Michael Larsen
                = succeed "," do
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Zhenghan+Wang"} Zhenghan Wang
                = succeed "," do
                  %em Topological quantum computation
                %strong 40
                (2003), 31-38 [
                %a{:href => "https://doi.org/10.1090/S0273-0979-02-00964-3"}> doi:10.1090/S0273-0979-02-00964-3
                ,
                = succeed "," do
                  %a{:href => "https://arxiv.org/abs/quant-ph/0101025"} arXiv:quant-ph/0101025
                = succeed "]" do
                  %a{:href => "http://www.ams.org/journals/bull/2003-40-01/S0273-0979-02-00964-3/S0273-0979-02-00964-3.pdf"} pdf
            %li#FreedmanLarsenWang02
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Michael+Freedman"}> Michael Freedman
                ,
                = succeed "," do
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Michael+Larsen"} Michael Larsen
                = succeed "," do
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Zhenghan+Wang"} Zhenghan Wang
                = succeed "," do
                  %em A modular functor which is universal for quantum computation
                %strong 227
                3 (2002) 605-622 [
                %a{:href => "https://doi.org/10.1007/s002200200645"}> doi:10.1007/s002200200645
                ,
                = succeed "]" do
                  %a{:href => "http://arxiv.org/abs/quant-ph/0001108"} arXiv:quant-ph/0001108
              %blockquote
                %p
                  (specifically via
                  = succeed ")" do
                    %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/su%282%29-anyons"} su(2)-anyons
            %li
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Chetan+Nayak"}> Chetan Nayak
                ,
                = succeed "," do
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Steven+H.+Simon"} Steven H. Simon
                = succeed "," do
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Ady+Stern"} Ady Stern
                = succeed "," do
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Michael+Freedman"} Michael Freedman
                = succeed "," do
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Sankar+Das+Sarma"} Sankar Das Sarma
                = succeed "," do
                  %em Non-Abelian Anyons and Topological Quantum Computation
                %strong 80
                1083 (2008) [
                %a{:href => "https://doi.org/10.1103/RevModPhys.80.1083"}> doi:10.1103/RevModPhys.80.1083
                ,
                = succeed "]" do
                  %a{:href => "http://arxiv.org/abs/0707.1889"} arXiv:0707.1888
            %li
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Dmitry+Melnikov"}> Dmitry Melnikov
                ,
                = succeed "," do
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Andrei+Mironov"} Andrei Mironov
                = succeed "," do
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Sergey+Mironov"} Sergey Mironov
                = succeed "," do
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Alexei+Morozov"} Alexei Morozov
                = succeed ":" do
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Andrey+Morozov"} Andrey Morozov
                = succeed "," do
                  %em Towards topological quantum computer
                = succeed "," do
                  %a{:href => "https://doi.org/10.1016/j.nuclphysb.2017.11.016"} doi:10.1016/j.nuclphysb.2017.11.016
                = succeed "]" do
                  %a{:href => "https://arxiv.org/abs/1703.00431"} arXiv:1703.00431
              %blockquote
                %p
                  (via
                  = succeed "-solutions" do
                    %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/R-matrix"} R-matrix
                  = succeed ")" do
                    %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/quantum+Yang-Baxter+equation"} quantum Yang-Baxter equation
          %p
            and via a
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Dijkgraaf-Witten+theory"} Dijkgraaf-Witten theory
            (like
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Chern-Simons+theory"} Chern-Simons theory
            but with
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/discrete+group"} discrete
            = succeed "):" do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/gauge+group"} gauge group
          %ul
            %li
              %p
                R. Walter Ogburn,
                = succeed "," do
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/John+Preskill"} John Preskill
                = succeed "," do
                  %em Topological Quantum Computation
                = succeed "," do
                  %em Quantum Computing and Quantum Communications
                = succeed "," do
                  %strong 1509
                = succeed "]" do
                  %a{:href => "https://doi.org/10.1007/3-540-49208-9_31"} doi:10.1007/3-540-49208-9_31
            %li
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Carlos+Mochon"}> Carlos Mochon
                ,
                = succeed "," do
                  %em Anyons from non-solvable finite groups are sufficient for universal quantum computation
                %strong 67
                022315 (2003) [
                %a{:href => "https://doi.org/10.1103/PhysRevA.67.022315"}> doi:10.1103/PhysRevA.67.022315
                ,
                = succeed "]" do
                  %a{:href => "https://arxiv.org/abs/quant-ph/0206128"} arXiv:quant-ph/0206128
            %li
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Carlos+Mochon"}> Carlos Mochon
                ,
                = succeed "," do
                  %em Anyon computers with smaller groups
                %strong 69
                032306 (2004) [
                %a{:href => "https://doi.org/10.1103/PhysRevA.69.032306"}> doi:10.1103/PhysRevA.69.032306
                ,
                = succeed "]" do
                  %a{:href => "https://arxiv.org/abs/quant-ph/0306063"} arXiv:quant-ph/0306063
          %p
            Proposals more specifically for topological quantum gates implemented in
            = succeed ":" do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/fractional+quantum+Hall+systems"} fractional quantum Hall systems
          %ul
            %li
              %p
                D. V. Averin, V.J. Goldman:
                = succeed "," do
                  %em Quantum computation with quasiparticles of the fractional quantum Hall effect
                %strong 121
                1 (2001) 25-28 [
                %a{:href => "https://doi.org/10.1016/S0038-1098(01)00447-1"}> doi:10.1016/S0038-1098(01)00447-1
                ,
                = succeed "]" do
                  %a{:href => "https://arxiv.org/abs/cond-mat/0110193"} arXiv:cond-mat/0110193
            %li
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Sankar+Das+Sarma"}> Sankar Das Sarma
                ,
                = succeed "," do
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Michael+Freedman"} Michael Freedman
                = succeed ":" do
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Chetan+Nayak"} Chetan Nayak
                = succeed "," do
                  %em Topologically-Protected Qubits from a Possible Non-Abelian Fractional Quantum Hall State
                %strong 94
                166802 (2005) [
                %a{:href => "https://doi.org/10.1103/PhysRevLett.94.166802"}> doi:10.1103/PhysRevLett.94.166802
                ,
                = succeed "]" do
                  %a{:href => "https://arxiv.org/abs/cond-mat/0412343"} arXiv:cond-mat/0412343
            %li
              %p
                Sergey Bravyi:
                = succeed "," do
                  %em
                    Universal Quantum Computation with the
                    %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                      %semantics
                        %mrow
                          %mi ν
                          %mo =
                          %mn 5
                          %mo{:stretchy => "false"} /
                          %mn 2
                        %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} \nu = 5/2
                    Fractional Quantum Hall State
                %strong 73
                042313 (2006) [
                %a{:href => "https://doi.org/10.1103/PhysRevA.73.042313 "}> doi:10.1103/PhysRevA.73.042313
                ,
                = succeed "]" do
                  %a{:href => "https://arxiv.org/abs/quant-ph/0511178"} arXiv:quant-ph/0511178
          %p Monographs:
          %ul
            %li
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Zhenghan+Wang"}> Zhenghan Wang
                ,
                = succeed "," do
                  %em Topological Quantum Computation
                = succeed "," do
